        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We operate a 24/7 CCTV‑monitored warehousing facility in Junagadh equipped with climate control and fire suppression systems. Goods can be stored securely for up to 30 days without additional handling fees. Each pallet is labeled, inventoried, and insured, ensuring your belongings remain safe until you’re ready for final delivery.</p>
